Subject: Register bundles: take the record path

What this does
  Register bundles: take the record path.

Why we need it
  `regvm_all_threaded` is a property of the interpreter build, never serialized.

What it adds
  Shared `regvm_code_all_threaded` helper used by the encoder and both read paths (eager + lazy materialization); lazy callee materialized before the record-eligibility test in the four call classifiers so a lazy bundle's `Error.stack` matches source.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
